{
	"about": "Golden cases for parseMoneyInput, formatMoneyDraft, decimalSeparator and groupSeparator (@retrospend/domain/parse). Every client runs this file. parse expects either { minor } or { error }. \u00a0 is a no-break space, \u202f a narrow no-break space, \u2212 the minus sign, \u00d7 times, \u00f7 divide.",
